    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“You don’t just march. You set tempo.</em>”</p><p>Your presence and banners teach people how to move like a single thought.</p><ul><li>When allies begin their turn within <strong>2 squares</strong> of you, they gain a <strong>+2 squares bonus</strong> to their walking speed until the end of that turn.</li><li>This doesn’t stack with itself, but it does play nicely with other speed increases (GM adjudicates edge cases).</li></ul><p><em>You don’t shout ‘Forward.’ You just start walking and the hex comes with you.</em></p>",
